title: <span class="generalitat-coalition" data-parties="psc [+ parlament_current_icv +]" data-summary="Minority government - [+ parlament_coalition_psc_icv_s +]/[+ parlament_s_majority +]"><span style="color: var(--psc); font-style: italic;">Progressive</span><span style="color: var(--[+ parlament_current_icv +]); font-style: italic;">Government</span></span>
subtitle: [? if progressist_erc_abstention_phase = 1: The first round of investiture negotiations begins.?][? if progressist_erc_abstention_phase = 2: The parties enter the second round of investiture negotiations.?][? if progressist_erc_abstention_phase = 3: The third and final round of investiture negotiations begins.?] ERC will remain outside the cabinet.
tags: event
new-page: true
view-if: progressist_erc_abstention_phase > 0 and player_party == "erc"
role: event

PSC and [+ parlament_current_icv +] ask ERC to permit their investiture. No ministries are on offer because ERC would remain outside government.

- @accept: Abstain on the current terms
- @social: Demand binding social-policy commitments
- @independence: Demand an independence commitment
- @reject: Reject the offer and request another round

@social
choose-if: not parlament_coalition_concessions_social
unavailable-subtitle: The cabinet has already accepted these social commitments.
on-arrival: {!
    Q.parlament_coalition_concessions_social = true;
    Q.psc_relations -= 2;
    Q[Q.parlament_current_icv + "_relations"] += 2;
!}
go-to: terms

@independence
choose-if: 1==0
unavailable-subtitle: The PSC and [+ parlament_current_icv +] will not accept an independence commitment as the price of ERC's abstention.

@terms

The revised abstention terms now include [? if parlament_coalition_concessions_social: binding social-policy guarantees?][? if not parlament_coalition_concessions_social: no binding social-policy guarantees?].

- @accept: Accept these terms
- @reject: Ask for a further round

@reject
on-arrival: {!
    Q.progressist_erc_abstention_phase += 1;
    Q.month_actions += 1;
    Q.psc_relations -= 2;
    Q[Q.parlament_current_icv + "_relations"] -= 1;
!}
go-to: failed if progressist_erc_abstention_phase > 3; post_event

The parties adjourn without agreement and will return with a finalized offer.

@accept
on-arrival: {!
    Q.progressist_erc_abstention_phase = 0;
    Q.erc_in_gob = false;
    Q.erc_supporting = true;
    Q.cup_in_gob = false;
    Q.cup_supporting = false;
    Q.position_disp = "<span style='font-style: italic'>Opposition</span>";
    Q.cat_coalition = ["psc", Q.parlament_current_icv];
    Q.cat_coalition_support = [];
    Q.cat_coalition_abstain = ["erc"];
    Q.cat_coalition_disp = G.governmentTooltip("generalitat", Q.cat_coalition, "Minority government enabled by ERC abstention - " + Q.parlament_coalition_psc_icv_s + "/" + Q.parlament_s_majority, '<span style="color: var(--psc); font-style: italic;">Progressive</span><span style="color: var(--' + Q.parlament_current_icv + '); font-style: italic;">Government</span>');
    Q.cat_coalition_dissent = 0;
    var comuns_leads = Q.parlament_current_icv_s > Q.psc_parlament_s;
    Q.parlament_coalition_proposal_president = comuns_leads ? Q.parlament_current_icv : "psc";
    Q.parlament_coalition_proposal_vp = comuns_leads ? "psc" : Q.parlament_current_icv;
    Q.parlament_coalition_proposal_economy = comuns_leads ? Q.parlament_current_icv : "psc";
    Q.parlament_coalition_proposal_interior = "psc";
    Q.parlament_coalition_proposal_health = "psc";
    Q.parlament_coalition_proposal_foreign = Q.parlament_current_icv;
    Q.parlament_coalition_proposal_education = Q.parlament_current_icv;
    Q.parlament_coalition_proposal_territory = Q.parlament_current_icv;
    Q.parlament_coalition_proposal_bnl = Q.parlament_current_icv;
!}
go-to: parlament_coalition_setnames
set-jump: resolved

ERC will abstain and allow the Progressive Government to take office...

@resolved

- @parlament_coalition_resolve: A new government is formed!

@failed
on-arrival: {!
    Q.progressist_erc_abstention_phase = 0;
    Q.parlament_repeat_election = true;
    Q.snap_blame = Q.player_party;
    Q.snap_counterparty = "psc";
    Q.snap_severity = 0.08;
!}
call: snap_election

No abstention agreement was reached. Parliament returns to the voters.

- @post_event
